Package: pcornet.synthetic
Title: PCORnet CDM Synthetic Database Generator
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("PCORnet", "Synthetic", , "synthetic@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates synthetic patient data following the PCORnet Common Data
    Model (CDM) schema. Creates two linked DuckDB databases: a Clinical Data
    Warehouse (CDW) with PCORnet tables and a Master Patient Index (MPI) for
    patient identity management. Supports three generation modes: clinically
    coherent profiles, random data, and Synthea import.
